        <descript>
            <abstract>Voting precincts for the State of Minnesota as of May 1, 2026. Includes precinct boundary changes and municipal boundary changes through May 1, 2026. Topological checks have been completed for this data. Includes election district attributes for each precinct from the statewide voter registration system.Metadata PDFDownloadData DownloadDownloadGeopackageDownload</abstract>
