        </posacc>
        <lineage>
            <procstep>
                <procdesc>Boundaries derived from Minnesota's City, Township, and Unorganized Territory (CTU) Boundaries dataset, U.S. Census redistricting data, and data from local governments. Boundaries incorporate election district boundary corrections made under MS 2.91, subd. 2 and MS 204B.146, subd. 3, Chapter 92 of 2022 MN Laws, Chapter 62 of 2023 MN Laws, and municipal boundary adjustments that were effective through May 1, 2026.</procdesc>
            </procstep>
        </lineage>
